  m_Text: '1. Move left and right with W&A on keyboard, or direction inputs on controller

    2.
    Attack by pressing spacebar on keyboard, or any of the face buttons on controller

    3.
    KO the opponent with a follow-up attack, performed by landing an attack on the
    opponent, then pressing attack again in quick succession'
